WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.730
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:09.000 --> 03:12.440
Why does she always have to keep hurting me?

3
03:12.520 --> 03:13.640
PREVIOUSLY

4
03:13.720 --> 03:17.360
I hate her, Mom. I hate her.

5
03:17.960 --> 03:20.320
I'm going to throw a party for Hathaya.

6
03:20.400 --> 03:24.640
Chayanee will get her drunk.

7
03:25.240 --> 03:26.760
Then you take care of her.

8
03:30.440 --> 03:32.240
Hey!

9
03:32.840 --> 03:34.000
What the hell is going on?

10
03:34.640 --> 03:37.400
This isn't what everyone thinks.

11
03:37.480 --> 03:38.400
I can explain.

12
03:40.800 --> 03:43.680
Everyone saw what kind of person you are,

13
03:43.760 --> 03:45.920
and you still have the nerve to deny it?!

14
03:46.000 --> 03:46.880
Wait!

15
03:47.400 --> 03:48.880
Listen to him first.

16
03:48.960 --> 03:51.240
Ramil, tell us what happened.

17
03:52.880 --> 03:54.440
I saw a man

18
03:55.400 --> 03:56.600
walking toward Hathaya's room,

19
03:56.680 --> 03:58.000
so I followed him

20
03:58.080 --> 04:00.680
and saw that he was trying to force himself on her.

21
04:00.760 --> 04:02.040
That's why I went in to help her.

22
04:02.960 --> 04:03.840
I can't believe

23
04:03.920 --> 04:06.600
you'd make up a lie like that just to save yourself.

24
04:07.640 --> 04:10.640
But the state you and Hathaya were in

25
04:10.720 --> 04:13.080
made it perfectly obvious what the two of you were doing.

26
04:16.480 --> 04:19.200
I'm telling the truth.

27
04:19.279 --> 04:20.720
Sir, if you don't believe me,

28
04:21.480 --> 04:23.840
have every man here brought in.

29
04:23.920 --> 04:25.600
I punched him.

30
04:25.680 --> 04:28.000
Whoever has bruises is the attacker.

31
04:32.520 --> 04:34.360
Go get all the workers and bring them here.

32
04:35.120 --> 04:38.560
Oh, this is far too serious.

33
04:38.640 --> 04:40.440
I'll handle it myself.

34
04:40.520 --> 04:42.200
I'll knock on every door.

35
04:42.280 --> 04:45.040
If anyone has injuries or bruises like Ramil said,

36
04:45.120 --> 04:47.280
I'll drag him straight to jail myself.

37
05:01.560 --> 05:02.560
Pong.

38
05:04.040 --> 05:05.720
Pong. It's me.

39
05:10.000 --> 05:12.720
I almost had her, then that bastard showed up.

40
05:12.800 --> 05:15.400
Don't say another word. Turn off the light and go to bed.

41
05:16.120 --> 05:18.280
Are you sure Mr. Pichai won't turn me over to the police?

42
05:18.360 --> 05:20.640
Don't worry. I'll handle it.

43
05:20.720 --> 05:22.520
Go on.

44
05:23.160 --> 05:24.440
Turn off the light.

45
05:34.000 --> 05:36.960
Father, I checked every room.

46
05:37.040 --> 05:38.640
None of our workers or gardeners

47
05:38.720 --> 05:41.320
has a single bruise on them.

48
05:41.400 --> 05:43.120
That's impossible. Someone has to!

49
05:43.200 --> 05:45.000
Are you accusing me of lying?

50
05:45.080 --> 05:46.920
Ramil, that's enough.

51
05:49.640 --> 05:52.480
Hathaya, what happened?

52
05:54.880 --> 05:57.560
I… I don't know, Grandpa.

53
05:58.320 --> 06:01.920
How can you not know? Ramil was lying in your room.

54
06:03.080 --> 06:04.600
All I remember is that

55
06:05.360 --> 06:08.200
I was very drunk and had a terrible headache.

56
06:08.280 --> 06:10.960
Then Chaya took me back to my room.

57
06:11.040 --> 06:13.080
Is that true?

58
06:18.080 --> 06:18.920
No.

59
06:21.440 --> 06:23.000
I was drinking with Hathaya,

60
06:24.480 --> 06:26.400
then I went to refill our drinks.

61
06:26.480 --> 06:28.360
When I came back, she was gone.

62
06:38.600 --> 06:40.000
That's not true.

63
06:42.040 --> 06:44.480
You were drinking with me,

64
06:44.560 --> 06:46.920
then you took me back to my room.

65
06:47.000 --> 06:49.240
I asked you to stay with me,

66
06:50.280 --> 06:52.600
and you promised you would.

67
06:54.480 --> 06:56.600
Hathaya, you must have been really drunk.

68
06:57.240 --> 06:59.840
The person who took you back to your room

69
06:59.920 --> 07:02.880
and stayed with you was Ramil.

70
07:05.520 --> 07:07.440
I told everyone already.

71
07:07.520 --> 07:10.760
I saw Hathaya lying there with a man.

72
07:10.840 --> 07:12.480
But I never imagined

73
07:12.560 --> 07:15.280
Ramil would do something so vile.

74
07:15.880 --> 07:16.840
That's not true.

75
07:18.040 --> 07:19.400
I never touched Hathaya like that.

76
07:20.640 --> 07:23.280
Ramil, stop lying.

77
07:23.360 --> 07:25.800
Everyone saw with their own eyes what was happening.

78
07:31.440 --> 07:32.600
Mr. Pichai,

79
07:34.240 --> 07:35.600
I sincerely apologize

80
07:36.720 --> 07:39.000
for everything that happened today.

81
07:39.080 --> 07:40.680
Someone from your household

82
07:40.760 --> 07:43.120
has disgraced Father.

83
07:43.200 --> 07:45.640
How will you take responsibility for this, Mr. Saksit?

84
07:46.240 --> 07:48.120
Well…

85
07:49.040 --> 07:50.440
I…

86
07:51.640 --> 07:54.640
-Well… -Well, Mr. Saksit?

87
07:54.720 --> 07:56.120
How will you take responsibility?

88
07:56.200 --> 07:58.680
Well, I…

89
07:58.760 --> 07:59.920
I'll take responsibility.

90
08:08.400 --> 08:10.200
How are you going to take responsibility?

91
08:10.800 --> 08:12.080
I ruined Hathaya’s reputation.

92
08:14.440 --> 08:15.560
I'll take care of her.

93
08:24.720 --> 08:25.800
Sir,

94
08:27.280 --> 08:28.680
what do you think?

95
08:31.080 --> 08:34.159
Ramil, you're a gentleman.

96
08:35.200 --> 08:37.720
If you did this, then you have to take responsibility.

97
08:39.240 --> 08:41.400
You will take Hathaya as your wife.

98
08:51.440 --> 08:52.520
Yes, sir.

99
08:58.680 --> 08:59.680
Grandpa.

100
09:00.400 --> 09:02.640
But I don't want that.

101
09:05.440 --> 09:06.280
Hathaya.

102
09:24.520 --> 09:26.920
I should never have taken you in.

103
09:27.000 --> 09:28.640
You've always been jealous of my son.

104
09:29.240 --> 09:31.360
You take everything that belongs to Raiwin.

105
09:31.440 --> 09:33.960
I set everything up for Raiwin

106
09:34.040 --> 09:35.960
to use Hathaya's fame for the election.

107
09:36.040 --> 09:37.440
And you came along

108
09:37.520 --> 09:39.680
and ruined the whole plan.

109
09:41.080 --> 09:43.320
You're completely brainless.

110
09:44.320 --> 09:47.840
And you even had the nerve to volunteer to take responsibility.

111
09:47.920 --> 09:49.680
What difference does it make?

112
09:49.760 --> 09:52.720
Even if I hadn't said I would take responsibility for Hathaya,

113
09:52.800 --> 09:55.000
you would've made me do it anyway.

114
09:55.080 --> 09:57.960
Take responsibility for something I never even did!

115
09:58.040 --> 09:59.920
Someone like you has no right

116
10:00.000 --> 10:02.480
to decide anything!

117
10:02.560 --> 10:04.040
I own your life!

118
10:05.400 --> 10:08.840
I'm the one who gives the orders.

119
10:08.920 --> 10:10.600
Get that through your head!

120
10:16.160 --> 10:17.160
Raiwin,

121
10:18.440 --> 10:19.600
Hathaya and I

122
10:20.480 --> 10:21.960
really didn't do anything.

123
10:22.880 --> 10:24.400
If you love her,

124
10:25.920 --> 10:28.280
-go tell Mr. Pichai. -Don't lecture me.

125
10:29.520 --> 10:31.280
You ruined everything.

126
10:31.360 --> 10:32.960
Remember this.

127
10:33.040 --> 10:36.240
I don't take another man's leftovers.

128
10:42.440 --> 10:45.560
Mom, I really didn't do anything.

129
10:45.640 --> 10:47.480
I never violated Hathaya.

130
10:48.560 --> 10:50.240
Stop causing trouble for once!

131
10:52.240 --> 10:54.240
If I could turn back time,

132
10:54.320 --> 10:56.760
I should've let your father take you and raise you.

133
10:56.840 --> 10:59.400
Then I wouldn't have to worry about you every single day.

134
11:00.160 --> 11:01.200
Mom.

135
11:02.920 --> 11:04.440
You don't believe me either?

136
11:06.280 --> 11:07.320
Fine!

137
11:07.400 --> 11:10.960
If I'm such a terrible, selfish person,

138
11:12.160 --> 11:13.880
then I'll become what you want me to be!

139
14:11.720 --> 14:12.720
Grandpa.

140
14:13.760 --> 14:15.200
I know I was very drunk that night,

141
14:15.920 --> 14:19.040
but Ramil and I really didn't go into the room together.

142
14:19.120 --> 14:20.880
Nothing happened between us.

143
14:21.680 --> 14:24.320
Ramil doesn't need to take responsibility for my life.

144
14:24.920 --> 14:28.120
Please let me stay here and take care of you.

145
14:30.560 --> 14:31.720
Please, Grandpa.

146
14:34.680 --> 14:35.760
Father.

147
14:36.560 --> 14:40.720
I had the staff pack all of Hathaya's

148
14:40.800 --> 14:42.400
clothes and belongings

149
14:42.480 --> 14:45.160
just as you ordered.

150
14:49.720 --> 14:52.360
When Mr. Saksit came to ask for your hand on Raiwin's behalf,

151
14:53.320 --> 14:54.760
I didn't object.

152
14:55.320 --> 14:58.400
I thought you deserved a good man

153
14:58.960 --> 15:00.600
and that your life might get better.

154
15:02.320 --> 15:03.520
But before anything happened,

155
15:04.440 --> 15:06.800
you secretly slept with his little brother.

156
15:08.200 --> 15:10.200
You brought this filthy mess into my house.

157
15:10.880 --> 15:12.680
You're no different from your mother.

158
15:13.400 --> 15:16.440
Since you chose to behave so disgracefully,

159
15:17.120 --> 15:18.400
go live with Ramil.

160
15:19.200 --> 15:21.760
I'm not going to hold a wedding and let people look down on us.

161
15:24.440 --> 15:27.120
If you finish working the full month you agreed to,

162
15:28.320 --> 15:30.320
I'll pay you 500,000.

163
15:31.240 --> 15:32.880
After that, I never want to see you again.

164
15:39.040 --> 15:41.360
Grandpa! Grandpa!

165
15:41.440 --> 15:44.600
I'm begging you. Please don't send me away.

166
15:44.680 --> 15:47.080
Let me stay here and take care of you.

167
15:47.160 --> 15:50.240
-Please, Grandpa. -Take your filthy hands off me.

168
15:51.040 --> 15:54.680
And get your bags out of here. I don't want to see your face anymore!

169
16:02.560 --> 16:04.840
If you tell me to do something,

170
16:05.920 --> 16:07.760
I'll do it.

171
16:09.680 --> 16:12.240
But I want to make one thing clear.

172
16:12.320 --> 16:14.760
I have never done anything disgraceful.

173
16:16.200 --> 16:18.880
I am not like my mother.

174
17:25.800 --> 17:27.079
Chaya.

175
17:28.119 --> 17:30.200
I really remember

176
17:31.720 --> 17:34.160
you taking me back to my room last night,

177
17:34.240 --> 17:35.960
and you stayed with me.

178
17:37.360 --> 17:40.640
Yes. I was with you.

179
17:41.360 --> 17:43.760
Then why didn't you tell Grandpa?

180
17:49.160 --> 17:51.080
Because I hate you.

181
17:54.280 --> 17:55.840
I hate you, Hathaya.

182
17:56.440 --> 17:57.840
I'm going to bring Hathaya back.

183
17:57.920 --> 17:59.520
I'll wait for you, Daddy.

184
17:59.600 --> 18:00.960
And I'll hurry back to you.

185
18:01.040 --> 18:02.120
Okay.

186
18:05.520 --> 18:09.240
Dad promised me he would come back.

187
18:11.760 --> 18:15.480
But he died because he went after you.

188
18:17.120 --> 18:19.120
He died because of you.

189
18:23.160 --> 18:25.320
I tried to come to terms with it.

190
18:25.400 --> 18:27.400
As I grew up, Grandpa loved me

191
18:27.480 --> 18:30.520
and took care of me. I was happy.

192
18:34.800 --> 18:36.240
I missed you so much, Grandpa.

193
18:36.320 --> 18:38.440
I love you more than anyone in the world.

194
18:42.720 --> 18:44.880
Then you came back

195
18:45.800 --> 18:48.360
and started taking everything in my life.

196
18:58.560 --> 19:01.560
You won Grandpa over by acting like such a good person.

197
19:02.640 --> 19:04.280
You kept showing off at work.

198
19:05.400 --> 19:07.880
And now you've even taken Raiwin from me.

199
19:10.520 --> 19:13.200
So, of course, I had to take back what belongs to me.

200
19:30.480 --> 19:33.720
Hathaya, your husband is here to pick you up.

201
19:33.800 --> 19:35.040
Go.

202
19:35.120 --> 19:39.680
And let me give you my blessing. May my beloved granddaughter…

203
19:39.760 --> 19:42.640
Oh, no. My most hated granddaughter

204
19:42.720 --> 19:44.400
find nothing but ruin.

205
19:59.760 --> 20:02.720
Miss Hathaya. Let me help you.

206
20:07.920 --> 20:10.440
I wish you the best of luck, Miss Hathaya.

207
20:11.160 --> 20:13.320
Please take care of yourself.

208
20:29.800 --> 20:31.120
She's gone, sweetheart.

209
20:31.800 --> 20:33.920
I finally got rid of her.

210
21:03.960 --> 21:05.440
Nothing happened between us.

211
21:06.840 --> 21:08.960
So why do you have to take responsibility?

212
21:13.960 --> 21:17.320
I tried everything, but nobody believes me.

213
21:17.400 --> 21:19.600
Even my own mother doesn't believe me.

214
21:20.320 --> 21:22.080
Then make them see the truth.

215
21:22.160 --> 21:25.080
Prove it. Make them understand.

216
21:25.680 --> 21:26.720
Believe me.

217
21:26.800 --> 21:29.720
I wanted to search the whole place for that pervert,

218
21:29.800 --> 21:32.880
but your aunt refused. What was I supposed to do?

219
21:38.600 --> 21:41.600
Why did something like this have to happen to me?

220
21:41.680 --> 21:43.960
Why do I have to come live with you?!

221
21:47.160 --> 21:49.480
Instead of thanking me

222
21:49.560 --> 21:51.440
for saving you from being raped

223
21:52.600 --> 21:55.440
and standing up for you, you're blaming me?

224
21:57.400 --> 21:58.600
Fine.

225
21:58.680 --> 22:01.040
If you hate staying here so much, get in the car.

226
22:03.240 --> 22:04.680
Let's go.

227
22:04.760 --> 22:07.560
No! Don't take my suitcase!

228
22:07.640 --> 22:09.760
I'm so terrible, right? Get in. I'll take you back.

229
22:09.840 --> 22:13.480
-No! Let go… Let go! -Get in the car. I'll take--

230
22:17.920 --> 22:19.520
I can't go back.

231
22:21.080 --> 22:23.560
I have to finish working here for one full month.

232
22:25.400 --> 22:28.520
I need the money to pay for my grandmother's treatment.

233
22:42.240 --> 22:44.080
Don't!

234
22:46.080 --> 22:47.040
Come inside.

235
22:52.600 --> 22:53.640
When you're ready,

236
22:54.840 --> 22:55.720
follow me.

237
23:16.040 --> 23:17.360
DUANGJAI'S FOOD STALL

238
23:17.440 --> 23:19.360
Get out of here

239
23:19.440 --> 23:21.600
or I'll call the police.

240
23:22.760 --> 23:24.600
Save what strength you have left.

241
23:25.120 --> 23:26.320
Where's your daughter?

242
23:26.400 --> 23:29.640
No idea. She doesn't live here anymore. Hasn't been back in a long time.

243
23:29.720 --> 23:31.320
What kind of game are you playing?

244
23:32.320 --> 23:34.040
She called and told me to come here.

245
23:34.680 --> 23:36.440
-Who called? -Your daughter.

246
23:36.520 --> 23:39.480
Or did she lie to us? Trash the place.

247
23:41.640 --> 23:43.640
-No! -You bastards, stop right now!

248
23:50.480 --> 23:52.040
Here's your money.

249
23:57.080 --> 23:58.400
The loan agreement.

250
24:09.120 --> 24:12.640
If you're ever short on cash, the boss says you can always borrow again.

251
24:14.080 --> 24:17.400
With interest that high? I'm rich now.

252
24:19.280 --> 24:20.120
Let's go.

253
24:26.480 --> 24:29.160
Hathai, where the hell have you been?

254
24:29.240 --> 24:31.720
And where did you get the money to pay them?

255
24:33.000 --> 24:36.160
Look at the way you're dressed.

256
24:36.240 --> 24:39.520
And that gold necklace. Where did you get all this money?

257
24:39.600 --> 24:41.080
Did you rob someone?

258
24:41.760 --> 24:45.880
Come on, Mom. Could you think something good about me for once?

259
24:47.200 --> 24:50.720
I ran for my life and ended up staying at that restaurant where I used to work.

260
24:51.640 --> 24:53.280
Then I met a new man.

261
24:54.400 --> 24:58.120
And this one is really good to me, Mom.

262
24:58.200 --> 25:01.240
He loves me and gives me everything I want.

263
25:01.840 --> 25:04.680
What does your husband do for a living to have that much money?

264
25:06.200 --> 25:08.280
You don't need to know.

265
25:09.200 --> 25:12.720
So, Mom. Are you still fainting and feeling sick?

266
25:13.320 --> 25:17.480
Depends on the day. I just keep taking my medicine and painkillers.

267
25:27.960 --> 25:29.960
Take this for now.

268
25:31.120 --> 25:34.960
When I get more money, I'll take you in for surgery.

269
25:35.040 --> 25:36.640
We won't have to wait for Hathaya.

270
25:44.720 --> 25:45.760
I have to go, Mom.

271
25:45.840 --> 25:47.600
You're not staying here?

272
25:48.480 --> 25:50.560
Bring your man to meet me too.

273
25:50.640 --> 25:52.800
Some other day.

274
25:56.560 --> 25:58.280
Who the hell is your man?

275
26:00.040 --> 26:03.880
Please, just don't let her cause any more trouble.

276
26:16.840 --> 26:18.880
Let me help you.

277
26:21.920 --> 26:23.120
Thank you.

278
26:27.320 --> 26:30.360
Only Max and I live in this house.

279
26:30.960 --> 26:33.800
Welcome, ma'am.

280
26:35.400 --> 26:38.480
I'm not staying here as his wife.

281
26:38.560 --> 26:40.760
I'm staying here as a coworker.

282
26:47.720 --> 26:50.920
Max, take her suitcase to my room.

283
26:51.000 --> 26:52.880
I told you already.

284
26:52.960 --> 26:55.600
I'm not staying here as your wife.

285
26:55.680 --> 26:57.400
I'm not sleeping in the same room as you.

286
26:59.800 --> 27:02.080
It's not like I'm dying to sleep with you either.

287
27:02.160 --> 27:05.000
I'll sleep in Max's room. Okay?

288
27:11.720 --> 27:12.800
And another thing.

289
27:13.640 --> 27:16.920
If you're not here as my wife,

290
27:18.680 --> 27:20.160
then you're the maid.

291
27:22.240 --> 27:23.360
The maid?

292
27:23.440 --> 27:27.640
Exactly. You'll clean, cook,

293
27:27.720 --> 27:32.080
and take care of all the laundry too. Okay?

294
27:33.800 --> 27:35.720
-But I-- -Don't say anything.

295
27:35.800 --> 27:36.880
That's an order.

296
27:42.320 --> 27:45.400
I am not washing your socks. And I'm definitely not washing your…

297
27:47.440 --> 27:51.640
underwear. I'm not your wife.

298
27:57.560 --> 27:58.720
Whatever.

299
28:07.240 --> 28:08.080
Wait.

300
28:14.520 --> 28:16.600
You're done eating? Cut the grass and tidy up after.

301
28:32.440 --> 28:34.280
Why are you wearing long sleeves?

302
28:35.400 --> 28:38.040
Why are you covering yourself up so much?

303
28:38.800 --> 28:41.080
The sun is hot, Auntie.

304
28:41.680 --> 28:44.680
Is it the sun, or are you hiding something?

305
28:44.760 --> 28:46.520
It's hot. I'm afraid of the sun.

306
28:46.600 --> 28:50.720
I didn't even put on sunscreen.

307
28:51.320 --> 28:52.880
Roll up your sleeve and let me see.

308
28:54.000 --> 28:55.560
What the hell, Auntie?

309
28:56.320 --> 28:58.120
Why should I have to do what you say?

310
28:58.720 --> 29:03.160
Last night, some pervert went into Miss Hathaya's room and tried to rape her.

311
29:03.240 --> 29:05.840
If you have nothing to hide, and you didn't do it,

312
29:06.480 --> 29:10.000
then roll up your sleeve. If you refuse,

313
29:10.080 --> 29:12.720
I'll tell Master that you're

314
29:12.800 --> 29:13.960
the most suspicious one here.

315
29:14.720 --> 29:16.120
You're talking nonsense.

316
29:16.200 --> 29:17.120
Roll up your sleeve.

317
29:17.200 --> 29:19.520
-I told you. My skin is sensitive. -Roll up your sleeve!

318
29:20.280 --> 29:21.320
Madam is calling you.

319
29:21.400 --> 29:23.520
Hurry. She's furious right now.

320
29:23.600 --> 29:24.560
Okay.

321
29:26.080 --> 29:28.400
Before you go, roll up your sleeve and let me see.

322
29:29.400 --> 29:32.760
What is wrong with you?

323
29:32.840 --> 29:37.360
Ramil admitted responsibility. He already took Hathaya home to live with him.

324
29:37.440 --> 29:39.640
Why are you still doing this?

325
29:39.720 --> 29:43.160
I trust Mr. Ramil, and I trust Miss Hathaya too.

326
29:43.240 --> 29:46.280
So you're saying

327
29:46.360 --> 29:48.680
you don't trust Madam?

328
29:49.280 --> 29:51.360
You want to challenge her?

329
29:51.440 --> 29:53.520
I'll tell Madam and have her fire you.

330
29:57.960 --> 30:01.680
Look. You're a maid.

331
30:01.760 --> 30:03.920
Don't try to play detective and catch criminals too.

332
30:04.600 --> 30:06.120
You know why?

333
30:06.200 --> 30:08.320
Because every one of them I've seen

334
30:08.920 --> 30:10.280
ends up dead.

335
30:12.480 --> 30:14.720
If you have work to do, go do it.

336
30:26.280 --> 30:27.400
Pong?

337
30:28.280 --> 30:30.880
Why are you here? I didn't call you.

338
30:32.840 --> 30:33.840
I called him.

339
30:35.840 --> 30:37.080
Chamoi!

340
30:37.160 --> 30:39.920
You're using my name to order people around now?

341
30:40.000 --> 30:41.240
You've gone too far.

342
30:41.320 --> 30:44.280
I was helping you.

343
30:44.360 --> 30:46.800
Ann was investigating

344
30:46.880 --> 30:48.800
who went into Miss Hathaya's room.

345
30:48.880 --> 30:52.200
Good thing I stepped in and saved him.

346
30:52.880 --> 30:55.160
Otherwise, Ann would've caught him.

347
30:56.000 --> 30:57.280
Wait.

348
30:58.760 --> 31:01.680
Chamoi. You know about this?

349
31:02.280 --> 31:04.640
Yes, madam.

350
31:05.600 --> 31:09.920
I do everything for you.

351
31:11.600 --> 31:14.080
And, well,

352
31:14.160 --> 31:17.520
I think a little appreciation would be nice.

353
31:17.600 --> 31:18.720
Ugh.

354
31:24.120 --> 31:25.640
Here, take it.

355
31:27.200 --> 31:29.520
Oh, thank you, ma'am!

356
31:35.840 --> 31:37.040
Pong.

357
31:37.720 --> 31:40.360
Put some cream on that bruise on your neck.

358
31:40.960 --> 31:42.520
Make sure it fades quickly.

359
31:43.400 --> 31:46.520
And don't let anyone catch you. Go.

360
31:47.920 --> 31:48.840
Yes, madam.

361
31:51.280 --> 31:52.240
Don't go yet.

362
31:56.200 --> 31:57.440
I have a job for you.

363
31:58.680 --> 32:00.160
Everyone did great today.

364
32:01.760 --> 32:03.760
Same time tomorrow.

365
32:03.840 --> 32:06.200
Don't be late. We're on a tight schedule. Understand?

366
32:06.280 --> 32:07.480
-Yes. -Yes.

367
32:07.560 --> 32:09.120
See you tomorrow.

368
32:10.280 --> 32:11.120
Let's go.

369
32:11.200 --> 32:12.640
Chayanee.

370
32:14.480 --> 32:17.240
What are you planning to have Pong and Chamoi help you with?

371
32:18.440 --> 32:21.280
Miss, don't tell me

372
32:21.360 --> 32:24.200
you want me doing construction work.

373
32:24.280 --> 32:27.520
I can't handle that. My arms and legs are too weak.

374
32:27.600 --> 32:29.640
I'm not making you do construction.

375
32:30.960 --> 32:32.760
I want you to deal with the workers.

376
32:36.360 --> 32:38.920
Hathaya brought these workers in

377
32:39.680 --> 32:43.160
and promised that if any of them caused trouble,

378
32:43.240 --> 32:44.720
she would take full responsibility.

379
32:45.480 --> 32:49.920
So you're trying to find a way to get Hathaya sent home.

380
32:50.520 --> 32:52.440
I'm going to send her home

381
32:52.520 --> 32:55.080
without a single baht.

382
32:58.040 --> 33:00.720
If there's anything you want me to do, just tell me.

383
33:14.560 --> 33:16.720
Delicious food is here!

384
33:21.760 --> 33:24.080
Why did you bring so much stuff?

385
33:24.920 --> 33:27.160
What is all this? Are you selling something?

386
33:27.240 --> 33:30.280
We're not selling anything. It's for you.

387
33:30.880 --> 33:33.800
What's going on? Who's kind enough to give us all this?

388
33:34.400 --> 33:38.160
My boss is a fan of yours.

389
33:38.240 --> 33:42.080
He saw your video and felt sorry for you. So he sent us

390
33:42.160 --> 33:44.880
to bring all this over to cheer you up.

391
33:44.960 --> 33:46.360
No, no. We can't accept all this.

392
33:48.280 --> 33:50.520
My boss

393
33:50.600 --> 33:54.640
really wanted you to have it. Accept his kindness. You have to finish it all.

394
33:54.720 --> 33:56.080
Then please thank your boss for us.

395
33:56.840 --> 34:00.200
No problem. We'll get going now.

396
34:00.280 --> 34:03.760
-Thank you. -Let's go.

397
34:13.920 --> 34:15.120
Madam.

398
34:16.000 --> 34:17.880
They completely fell for it.

399
34:19.000 --> 34:20.560
Think they'll eat and drink all that?

400
34:21.280 --> 34:24.560
With all that delicious food? They'd be crazy not to.

401
34:24.639 --> 34:27.480
You were the one who told me they're heavy drinkers, Mom.

402
34:27.560 --> 34:29.880
That's right.

403
34:29.960 --> 34:32.719
This time, they'll miss work,

404
34:32.800 --> 34:35.800
and Hathaya will have to take responsibility.

405
34:37.840 --> 34:39.920
Tomorrow, we can wait for the good news.

406
34:51.239 --> 34:53.880
Why would they suddenly

407
34:53.960 --> 34:56.880
give us all this food for free?

408
34:57.600 --> 35:01.320
I already told you. They like us. They're fans.

409
35:01.400 --> 35:05.400
How do you know it isn't poisoned?

410
35:05.480 --> 35:09.560
Have you been watching too many dramas?

411
35:09.640 --> 35:10.480
All right.

412
35:11.160 --> 35:14.600
I'll taste it for you.

413
35:23.360 --> 35:25.280
Ya!

414
35:25.360 --> 35:28.040
Just kidding. It's delicious.

415
35:28.120 --> 35:30.240
If none of you want it, I'll eat it all myself.

416
35:30.320 --> 35:31.320
Hey!

417
35:31.400 --> 35:32.520
Let's eat.

418
35:35.160 --> 35:36.000
TWELVE BOTTLES

419
35:37.040 --> 35:38.000
Move.

420
35:39.720 --> 35:40.560
Wit,

421
35:41.160 --> 35:43.240
two or three bottles should be enough.

422
35:43.320 --> 35:45.080
Getting drunk will ruin work tomorrow.

423
35:45.160 --> 35:47.240
Come on. Just a little for medicinal purposes.

424
35:47.320 --> 35:49.120
Drink responsibly.

425
35:49.200 --> 35:51.080
Don't do anything that'll make Hathaya look bad.

426
35:51.160 --> 35:52.920
On my honor,

427
35:53.000 --> 35:56.560
I swear I'll only have a tiny bit. I'll save my strength for work tomorrow.

428
35:59.360 --> 36:01.800
Let's drink!

429
36:04.200 --> 36:05.520
Let's eat.

430
36:05.600 --> 36:07.960
-Here! -Dig in!

431
36:08.040 --> 36:09.280
Let's eat.

432
36:09.360 --> 36:10.760
Come on.

433
36:26.560 --> 36:28.320
I'm going to check the model home.

434
36:29.960 --> 36:31.440
Wait. Wait.

435
36:36.720 --> 36:37.640
What?

436
36:38.720 --> 36:40.120
Am I that disgusting?

437
36:41.080 --> 36:44.120
No. You just startled me.

438
36:44.200 --> 36:45.960
You suddenly reached for me.

439
36:47.200 --> 36:50.000
You forgot your bag.

440
36:53.400 --> 36:54.400
Thanks.

441
36:56.480 --> 36:57.480
Boss,

442
36:59.120 --> 37:00.280
this is all who showed up.

443
37:02.520 --> 37:03.840
Why are there so few?

444
37:03.920 --> 37:05.640
I don't know either.

445
37:05.720 --> 37:08.920
Yesterday, when everyone finished work, I kept reminding them not to be late.

446
37:09.000 --> 37:10.480
Aow's crew hasn't shown up either.

447
37:23.360 --> 37:24.200
‎Sir.

448
37:30.320 --> 37:32.600
There are a lot of reservations.

449
37:33.240 --> 37:35.400
Miss Hathaya takes very good care of the customers.

450
37:35.480 --> 37:38.040
Anyone visiting the model home decides to reserve right away.

451
37:41.440 --> 37:42.480
Father,

452
37:42.560 --> 37:45.200
why don't you go inspect the construction site?

453
37:46.800 --> 37:50.080
Ramil is already supervising the work. I don't want to interfere.

454
37:50.160 --> 37:52.400
Grandpa, you shouldn't trust people so easily.

455
37:52.480 --> 37:54.520
Some of the workers didn't even show up today.

456
38:01.000 --> 38:03.480
DO NOT ENTER

457
38:11.360 --> 38:13.600
Ya! Wake up!

458
38:13.680 --> 38:16.280
Wit! Aow! Everyone, wake up!

459
38:17.760 --> 38:20.120
-Ya. -Hathaya…

460
38:20.200 --> 38:24.520
Come drink with us.

461
38:24.600 --> 38:26.240
Ya!

462
38:26.320 --> 38:29.840
Wit! Aow! Wake up! Everyone, get up!

463
38:35.640 --> 38:37.320
Hathaya, move.

464
38:41.480 --> 38:45.720
Aow! Flood! The water's coming. Run!

465
38:47.320 --> 38:48.680
Hello, sir.

466
38:48.760 --> 38:50.600
There's no flood.

467
38:50.680 --> 38:54.320
I'm so sorry.

468
38:55.200 --> 38:58.600
What happened? Why are all of you this drunk?

469
38:59.720 --> 39:04.360
Yesterday, some fans brought us food. They said they liked us.

470
39:06.040 --> 39:09.560
I warned everyone not to drink so much that it would interfere with work.

471
39:10.560 --> 39:13.480
And look at you. You joined them too.

472
39:16.040 --> 39:17.720
How are you supposed to work

473
39:18.560 --> 39:20.520
when you're this drunk?!

474
39:21.680 --> 39:26.000
Looks like they have to take today off. Good thing Mr. Pichai isn't in today.

475
39:29.480 --> 39:31.400
MR. PICHAI

476
39:32.400 --> 39:33.320
Mr. Pichai.

477
39:41.680 --> 39:42.600
Yes, sir.

478
39:45.160 --> 39:46.120
I'm at the site.

479
39:47.840 --> 39:49.800
Okay. See you shortly.

480
39:53.400 --> 39:54.480
He's inspecting the site.

481
39:55.160 --> 39:57.280
We're dead.

482
39:57.360 --> 40:00.640
He strictly banned drinking. If he sees you like this,

483
40:00.720 --> 40:01.920
you'll all be fired.

484
40:02.000 --> 40:04.720
None of you thought this through!

485
40:04.800 --> 40:07.360
Have you forgotten that Hathaya vouched for all of you?

486
40:07.440 --> 40:09.760
If he finds out about this,

487
40:09.840 --> 40:11.760
Hathaya is the one who'll suffer. Get it?

488
40:13.680 --> 40:15.240
Hathaya, we're sorry.

489
40:15.320 --> 40:18.440
We're really sorry. Please forgive us.

490
40:19.040 --> 40:21.400
I can work. Can you guys work?

491
40:21.480 --> 40:24.440
-Yes. -Yes.

492
40:24.520 --> 40:28.360
I'll hurry and change. Then I'll get straight to work.

493
40:31.960 --> 40:35.320
You and Max should go meet Grandpa first.

494
40:35.400 --> 40:37.680
I'll take care of everything here. Go.

495
41:00.600 --> 41:02.840
Everyone, hurry.

496
41:02.920 --> 41:04.640
Faster, please.

497
41:06.360 --> 41:08.800
Pick everything up. Get rid of all of it.

498
41:11.040 --> 41:14.080
Come on, give me the broom.

499
41:14.160 --> 41:16.880
Hurry, everyone. Please hurry.

500
41:17.880 --> 41:20.720
Huh? Why are there so few workers?

501
41:21.800 --> 41:23.280
Where did everyone go?

502
41:24.640 --> 41:27.280
Exactly. And Ramil is gone too.

503
41:27.360 --> 41:29.360
Hello, sir.

504
41:29.440 --> 41:32.880
I told you not to trust him.

505
41:32.960 --> 41:35.800
Lately, Ramil has been slacking off

506
41:35.880 --> 41:37.800
and making mistakes constantly.

507
41:37.880 --> 41:41.840
I'm sorry if I gave you the impression that we were slacking off, Ms. Liu.

508
41:41.920 --> 41:46.400
I was talking to the contractor.

509
41:46.480 --> 41:49.960
He's about to come in and install the electrical wiring.

510
41:50.680 --> 41:52.280
That's right, sir.

511
41:52.880 --> 41:55.960
Where are all our workers? Is this everyone?

512
41:56.640 --> 41:58.000
Where are the new workers?

513
42:00.040 --> 42:01.760
Well, Mr. Ramil?

514
42:01.840 --> 42:05.520
Where are the workers Hathaya brought in?

515
42:12.040 --> 42:13.600
Is everyone ready?

516
42:13.680 --> 42:16.360
-Ready! -We're ready.

517
42:16.440 --> 42:19.440
-I forgot my hard hat! -Come on.

518
42:20.280 --> 42:22.400
Aow, hide the beer bottles.

519
42:22.480 --> 42:24.200
-Make sure they're out of sight. -Yes.

520
42:25.800 --> 42:27.840
Let's go. Hurry!

521
42:27.920 --> 42:31.280
-Don't forget anything. ID and hard hat? -I have them.

522
42:31.360 --> 42:34.120
Come on! Hurry!

523
42:38.800 --> 42:41.600
-I think they're coming-- -Well?

524
42:42.240 --> 42:44.000
Where are Hathaya's workers?

525
42:45.520 --> 42:46.720
Chayanee.

526
42:47.880 --> 42:49.320
Were you looking for my workers?

527
42:49.920 --> 42:52.320
Hello. Hello.

528
42:53.080 --> 42:56.360
Where have you all been? Why weren't you at the work site?

529
42:57.360 --> 42:59.360
I sent them to help with another job.

530
42:59.440 --> 43:02.440
Father asked the workers. You don't need to answer for them.

531
43:02.520 --> 43:05.160
Well? Where were you?

532
43:06.960 --> 43:10.120
We went… went…

533
43:10.200 --> 43:13.360
Went where? You can't even speak properly.

534
43:13.440 --> 43:15.280
My husband has a stutter.

535
43:15.360 --> 43:18.000
We went to help with the garden at the model home.

536
43:18.080 --> 43:20.040
Next time, unless it's urgent,

537
43:21.000 --> 43:23.800
don't move workers to another job. We're rushing things over here.

538
43:25.160 --> 43:26.760
I'm sorry, Grandpa.

539
43:27.600 --> 43:31.360
Grandpa, why don't we go to the model home?

540
43:33.720 --> 43:35.040
What's the matter?

541
43:35.120 --> 43:38.840
Well, Hathaya said she sent the workers to work on the garden.

542
43:39.640 --> 43:41.840
The garden must look beautiful now.

543
43:42.840 --> 43:45.440
I thought you might like to take a walk.

544
43:46.560 --> 43:48.080
Let's go, Father.

545
43:48.920 --> 43:50.080
I don't want to see the garden.

546
43:51.000 --> 43:52.800
I'd rather inspect the construction.

547
43:53.400 --> 43:55.080
And I need to talk to Ramil about Phase Two.

548
43:55.160 --> 43:57.960
Yes, sir. This way, please.

549
43:58.040 --> 44:00.920
It's hot here. Let's go.

550
44:01.000 --> 44:03.720
Let me hold the umbrella.

551
44:07.120 --> 44:08.920
Go back to work.

552
44:09.000 --> 44:10.280
Yes, Hathaya.

553
44:16.320 --> 44:18.160
Sorry about my husband.

554
44:20.520 --> 44:22.360
Go!

555
44:22.440 --> 44:24.120
Can't you walk properly?

556
44:24.200 --> 44:27.000
I'm nauseous. Morning sickness.

557
44:28.640 --> 44:31.080
-Sympathy morning sickness. -Get far away from me!

558
44:34.120 --> 44:36.080
I need to get back to work.

559
44:36.160 --> 44:38.720
I don't want to waste any time.

560
44:44.080 --> 44:45.080
Ugh.

561
45:00.400 --> 45:01.800
They drank so much.

562
45:02.560 --> 45:04.040
How are they still able to work?

563
45:04.680 --> 45:06.320
I think they can really hold their liquor.

564
45:06.400 --> 45:11.040
Next time, we should buy them another two or three cases, madam.

565
45:12.800 --> 45:14.280
Nobody asked you.

566
45:15.120 --> 45:17.520
Chayanee, I hate that Hathaya.

567
45:17.600 --> 45:19.960
Look at her strutting around as if nothing happened.

568
45:22.920 --> 45:24.440
Don't worry, Mom.

569
45:25.200 --> 45:27.680
I'll find a way to get rid of her.

570
45:29.200 --> 45:30.200
Come on.

571
45:31.240 --> 45:32.720
Walk faster.

572
45:34.960 --> 45:36.080
Quickly.

573
45:40.400 --> 45:44.040
If you have something to say to Hathaya,

574
45:44.120 --> 45:45.160
say it now.

575
45:46.120 --> 45:50.160
Hathaya, I'm sorry.

576
45:50.240 --> 45:51.920
I'm really sorry.

577
45:52.480 --> 45:54.080
I'm sorry.

578
45:54.960 --> 45:58.400
Hathaya, please forgive us.

579
45:59.240 --> 46:01.240
I'm not forgiving any of you.

580
46:04.920 --> 46:06.800
Mr. Pichai once asked me

581
46:07.880 --> 46:11.120
why I decided to help you

582
46:16.200 --> 46:18.520
when you weren't my relatives or even people I knew.

583
46:21.280 --> 46:24.560
I helped because I believed that if people are given a good opportunity,

584
46:24.640 --> 46:26.160
they can build a better life.

585
46:28.520 --> 46:31.560
But you threw away the opportunity I gave you.

586
46:35.600 --> 46:36.800
Do you realize

587
46:37.840 --> 46:40.240
that if Mr. Pichai had found out today

588
46:40.320 --> 46:43.520
that you were drunk and didn't show up for work,

589
46:44.920 --> 46:46.600
you would've been fired?

590
46:48.720 --> 46:50.320
Then where would you live?

591
46:53.080 --> 46:54.280
What would you eat?

592
46:58.800 --> 47:02.000
Or do you want to go back to wandering around with nowhere to live?

593
47:02.080 --> 47:05.720
Do you want people looking down on you again, calling you garbage

594
47:05.800 --> 47:07.480
and troublemakers?

595
47:08.680 --> 47:09.640
Is that what you want?

596
47:14.560 --> 47:15.640
Aow.

597
47:17.480 --> 47:19.440
You and the others risked your lives

598
47:19.520 --> 47:22.320
traveling all this way to work in Thailand.

599
47:24.840 --> 47:28.080
It wasn't easy to find a job or get your documents.

600
47:31.480 --> 47:33.680
You had to spend so much money.

601
47:36.120 --> 47:38.200
Why didn't you think about your parents?

602
47:38.280 --> 47:40.600
Why didn't you think about your kids waiting back home?

603
47:42.840 --> 47:44.960
You came here to work,

604
47:45.040 --> 47:48.520
send money home, and eventually return to your family.

605
47:48.600 --> 47:49.680
Isn't that what you wanted?

606
47:50.840 --> 47:54.560
So why throw everything away just for a little fun?

607
48:00.600 --> 48:02.600
If Mr. Pichai had found out,

608
48:04.240 --> 48:07.160
I would've lost my job and been sent home.

609
48:08.760 --> 48:10.280
What did I do wrong?

610
48:18.200 --> 48:22.040
I came here to work and save money for my grandmother's treatment.

611
48:22.800 --> 48:25.560
I tried to do something good and help all of you.

612
48:27.960 --> 48:30.480
Why did you repay me like this?

613
48:41.040 --> 48:42.920
If everyone is going to be selfish,

614
48:44.120 --> 48:46.040
then I'll be selfish too.

615
48:47.160 --> 48:49.480
From now on, we stay out of each other's lives.

616
48:50.360 --> 48:51.840
I'm not helping anyone anymore.

617
48:57.080 --> 48:59.960
Hathaya! I'm sorry!

618
49:00.040 --> 49:02.880
-I'm sorry! -I'm sorry!

619
49:02.960 --> 49:04.600
Please forgive me.

620
49:04.680 --> 49:06.640
Mom! Don't transfer any money to Dad.

621
49:07.240 --> 49:10.720
If you don't pay me back, don't ever show your face to me again.

622
49:11.520 --> 49:12.680
I hate you.

623
49:12.760 --> 49:15.760
From now on, you'll have a new foreman

624
49:15.840 --> 49:16.800
supervising your work.

625
49:16.880 --> 49:19.040
But Ramil already supervises us.

626
49:19.640 --> 49:23.280
He's been nowhere to be seen for days. And you call that a good supervisor?

627
49:23.360 --> 49:24.880
You should know

628
49:24.960 --> 49:26.680
that what you're doing

629
49:26.760 --> 49:28.920
is causing a lot of trouble for the workers.

630
49:29.000 --> 49:32.040
Don't act like my mother and lecture me.

631
49:32.640 --> 49:35.080
Have you forgotten yourself? Thinking you're my wife now?

632
49:35.160 --> 49:36.920
Don't act so disgusting with me.

633
49:37.000 --> 49:38.960
NEXT EPISODE

